[{"client_msg_id":"7989c284-5480-4c57-8569-db48826f38dd","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"前に生姜焼きに砂糖なしでハチミツで作ったら結構良かった\nちゃんと甘みはあるけどくどく無い、的な","ts":"1619533155.498100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xzs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"04039e15-5001-4e58-af11-c02f51ca0f2b","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"砂糖を上手く使うの難しいですよね","ts":"1619533066.498000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BhrxG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e69a3c65-1379-4980-a52d-76045b8c5f4b","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"おいしそう...","ts":"1619532604.497900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FK1D"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5868481e-bff1-4ab0-80e0-5b1d59d9a577","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"お肉と野菜って、おいしくなる温度帯や時間が全然違いますからねぇ。","ts":"1619532247.497600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"O98FF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8f6f7412-3199-4cbe-8509-75c1eec6fa5c","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"なお↑のスレッド内の焼き方は、別にシャトーブリアンじゃなくても、厚めのお肉なら大体おいしく焼けます。僕は年寄りに食べさせるのが目的なのでシャトーブリアンなんだけどもw","ts":"1619532202.496800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BAM=H"}]},{"client_msg_id":"FAC1BA04-09E0-4C18-9034-245677FB342C","type":"message","user":"U843L486L","text":"なるほど。鍋を二つに分けるのはいいアイディアですね。\n肉汁を野菜に活用することに着目していたんですけど、ネギ焼きをうまくするには汁がない方が焼きやすいし、セパレートするとうまくいく気がしてきました。","ts":"1619532074.496700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aYi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"efc43bed-9cf8-48c7-9a4d-b924e4f7a877","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"1インチ以上の厚さのあるヒレ、できればシャトーブリアン、あまり脂の乗ってないのを、魚焼きグリルで10分焼くのです。","ts":"1619531860.492800","thread_ts":"1619531860.492800","reply_count":2,"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["UAZ33BKV2"]},{"name":"hee","count":1,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS"]},{"name":"syokunin","count":1,"users":["U843L486L"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bxys"}]},{"client_msg_id":"447e0ff3-8ad2-4a0a-a9b7-5f858cb92ace","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"魚焼きグリルで焼くのです","ts":"1619531810.491500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9sFn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f4614a16-45fe-42d6-92a8-d2c4bf82a441","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"おいしい赤身のステーキ(それなりの食感)が喰いたい...","ts":"1619531721.490900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Jatm8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7d244709-bbd2-411a-a0ac-324cdb667895","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"まー、あれも極端ですしね \u0026gt;サシ","ts":"1619531699.490500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tLF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"593a0eea-4637-4dcc-a2c4-abbad62d95b1","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"サシが強すぎる牛もNGになると思うんだよなぁ。","ts":"1619531631.490200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mBOwG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ea6ee124-b703-4cfa-9373-832d995431b8","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"んーなんとなく魯山人が牛肉に何を求めていたのか、わかる気がするな。","ts":"1619531589.489600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"c8q"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e661bff1-f0b3-4a38-a839-4b2346a8f317","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"野菜用の鍋は、少しの牛脂が入ってるとそれっぽくなるかも。","ts":"1619531505.488700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9lFN7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"12887c1c-355b-4e3c-8215-1436884b157f","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"敢えて言えば肉用の鍋と、野菜用の鍋を分けるとかかな。","ts":"1619531480.488200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YYp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4aa34726-b739-4e56-9918-4a068b768c6d","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"いやーこれは家庭で楽しむのはムズイね。","ts":"1619531450.487800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"I+bje"}]},{"client_msg_id":"519e4d72-8de3-4379-aa9b-2d7b37afff4d","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"\u0026gt; 砂糖の乱用が各々の持つこところの異なった味を破壊し、本質を滅茶苦茶にしている如き、それである。砂糖さえ入れればうまいとする今の料理は、極端に味覚の低下を示している\nあーこれは今はさらに顕著かもしれない。同意できるわ。","ts":"1619531294.487400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ghUT8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"A6BA942D-64A2-461D-93B8-0BD3C890CE92","type":"message","user":"U843L486L","text":"【リスナーからのお悩み相談】ソドー島にお住まいのguyonさんより\n\n“すき焼きがけっこう好きで、ロマンを求めて何回か「魯山人風すき焼き」にチャレンジしているのですが、いつも野菜のターンでうまくいきません。そうなると、家族は肉と野菜一緒に食べたがってしまいます。\nこの料理をうまく自宅で楽しむ工夫やアイディアはありますか？”\n\n\u003chttps://www.yuasasyouyu.co.jp/%E9%A3%9F%E3%81%AE%E7%8F%BE%E5%A0%B4%E3%81%8B%E3%82%89/%E9%AD%AF%E5%B1%B1%E4%BA%BA%E3%81%AE%E3%81%99%E3%81%8D%E7%84%BC%E3%81%8D%E3%81%8C%E5%B9%B3%E6%88%90%E3%81%AE%E4%B8%96%E3%81%AB%E8%98%87%E3%81%88%E3%82%8B|https://www.yuasasyouyu.co.jp/食の現場から/魯山人のすき焼きが平成の世に蘇える\u003e！/","ts":"1619530618.486600","attachments":[{"fallback":"魯山人のすき焼きが平成の世に蘇える！ « 湯浅醤油有限会社|世界一の醤油をつくりたい 湯浅醤油有限会社|世界一の醤油をつくりたい","id":1,"title":"魯山人のすき焼きが平成の世に蘇える！ « 湯浅醤油有限会社|世界一の醤油をつくりたい 湯浅醤油有限会社|世界一の醤油をつくりたい","title_link":"https://www.yuasasyouyu.co.jp/%E9%A3%9F%E3%81%AE%E7%8F%BE%E5%A0%B4%E3%81%8B%E3%82%89/%E9%AD%AF%E5%B1%B1%E4%BA%BA%E3%81%AE%E3%81%99%E3%81%8D%E7%84%BC%E3%81%8D%E3%81%8C%E5%B9%B3%E6%88%90%E3%81%AE%E4%B8%96%E3%81%AB%E8%98%87%E3%81%88%E3%82%8B","text":"数多くの食の逸話を残した北大路魯山人。かなりの食通として名を残しているが、すでに昔のことなので、同じものを味わったという人の話を聞くことが少ない。しかし、彼がどんな嗜好を持っていたのか誰しも興味津々で、可能なら同じものを味わってみたいと考えるのは人の常であろう。今回、「名料理、かく語りき」の取材から魯山人のすき焼きを再現してみようとの話が出た。再現するのは「北新地湯木」の湯木尚二さん。文献を熟読し、彼なりのアレンジを加えながらも蘇った魯山人風すき焼きとはどんなものだろうか。","thumb_url":"https://www.yuasasyouyu.co.jp/wp/wp-content/uploads/2015/10/vo12-21.jpg","blocks":null,"service_name":"yuasasyouyu.co.jp","service_icon":"https://www.yuasasyouyu.co.jp/wp/wp-content/themes/yuasasyouyu/favicon.ico","thumb_width":142,"thumb_height":142,"from_url":"https://www.yuasasyouyu.co.jp/%E9%A3%9F%E3%81%AE%E7%8F%BE%E5%A0%B4%E3%81%8B%E3%82%89/%E9%AD%AF%E5%B1%B1%E4%BA%BA%E3%81%AE%E3%81%99%E3%81%8D%E7%84%BC%E3%81%8D%E3%81%8C%E5%B9%B3%E6%88%90%E3%81%AE%E4%B8%96%E3%81%AB%E8%98%87%E3%81%88%E3%82%8B","original_url":"https://www.yuasasyouyu.co.jp/%E9%A3%9F%E3%81%AE%E7%8F%BE%E5%A0%B4%E3%81%8B%E3%82%89/%E9%AD%AF%E5%B1%B1%E4%BA%BA%E3%81%AE%E3%81%99%E3%81%8D%E7%84%BC%E3%81%8D%E3%81%8C%E5%B9%B3%E6%88%90%E3%81%AE%E4%B8%96%E3%81%AB%E8%98%87%E3%81%88%E3%82%8B"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SRhns"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0fe1757b-557d-47f5-989d-001105121569","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"硬…っと思ったけど食べてると美味い\n固くはなってるけどパサパサではないのでこれはこれで趣きが違って美味い","ts":"1619527889.484200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jMFs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ce908dcb-b3ea-4701-89b8-ce46256328f6","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"めっちゃ真面目に作った！優勝！！","ts":"1619527791.483900","files":[{"id":"F0205BTSQSW","created":1619527776,"timestamp":1619527776,"name":"20210427_214926.jpg","title":"20210427_214926.jpg","mimetype":"image/jpeg","image_exif_rotation":0,"filetype":"jpg","pretty_type":"JPEG","user":"U01D9BALEKU","mode":"hosted","editable":false,"is_external":false,"external_type":"","size":641473,"url":"","url_download":"","url_private":"https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T03C4RC8V-F0205BTSQSW/20210427_214926.jpg","url_private_download":"https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T03C4RC8V-F0205BTSQSW/download/20210427_214926.jpg","original_h":